  hazardName: Failure to follow the three-point contact rule while using an A-frame
    ladder
  description: Before starting work on an A-frame ladder, the required work permit
    must be obtained. While using the ladder, apply the three-point contact rule
    by ensuring that two hands and one foot, or two feet and one hand, are always
    in contact with the ladder steps and handrails.
